      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain in patients who have cancer can be caused by direct effects of the tumor or by complications of treatment, or it can be unrelated to the disease or its treatment. This article discusses interventional pain procedures in the treatment of head and neck pain as they relate to malignancies and cervicogenic headache and neck pain."},
